  "name": "programming_in_lean",
  "description": "An educational resource and interactive tutorial for programming and formal verification using the Lean theorem prover. It leverages Emacs Org-mode to generate structured HTML and PDF documentation while providing integrated testing for Lean code snippets. The project covers foundational concepts from basic data types and recursion to advanced topics like monads, tactic writing, and proof automation.",
